WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.329
The long winter ended.

2
00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:24.562
The bright sun made the riverbank green.

3
00:00:24.563 --> 00:00:28.141
The river flowed and sparkled again.

4
00:00:28.142 --> 00:00:31.488
It was finally spring!

5
00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:35.406
Rat and Mole planned to go boating.

6
00:00:35.407 --> 00:00:40.534
"But first, breakfast!" said Rat, as he ate his egg.

7
00:00:40.535 --> 00:00:43.274
Mole finished his toast and jelly.

8
00:00:43.275 --> 00:00:46.343
They heard a knock at Rat's door.

9
00:00:46.344 --> 00:00:49.534
"Mole, I'm still eating," said Rat.

10
00:00:49.535 --> 00:00:51.797
"Will you answer the door?"

11
00:00:51.798 --> 00:00:55.536
"Sure," said Mole.

12
00:00:55.537 --> 00:01:00.970
Mole ran to the door and opened it.

13
00:01:00.971 --> 00:01:04.541
"Mr. Badger!" cried Mole.

14
00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:07.659
Rat dropped his fork.

15
00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:10.672
"Badger? Here?" said Rat.

16
00:01:10.673 --> 00:01:13.938
"He hardly ever leaves the Wild Wood!"

17
00:01:13.939 --> 00:01:16.938
Badger walked into the room.

18
00:01:16.939 --> 00:01:20.335
"The hour has come!" said Badger.

19
00:01:20.336 --> 00:01:22.933
Mole looked at the clock on the wall.

20
00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:25.869
"What hour?" asked Mole.

21
00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:29.276
"You should say whose hour!

22
00:01:29.277 --> 00:01:34.138
It is the hour for Toad!" cried Badger.

23
00:01:34.139 --> 00:01:37.735
"What?" asked Rat, scratching his head.

24
00:01:37.736 --> 00:01:41.476
"Winter is over," said Badger.

25
00:01:41.477 --> 00:01:44.133
"We must take care of Toad!"

26
00:01:44.134 --> 00:01:47.739
"Hooray!" shouted Mole.

27
00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:50.619
He jumped up and down.

28
00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:52.068
"When?"

29
00:01:52.069 --> 00:01:54.735
"Right now!" said Badger.

30
00:01:54.736 --> 00:01:58.357
"Toad just bought another big car!"

31
00:01:58.358 --> 00:02:02.541
"Oh no," said Rat, getting up from the table.

32
00:02:02.542 --> 00:02:06.941
"We must get to Toad Hall," cried Mole.

33
00:02:06.942 --> 00:02:12.740
"Before it's too late!" added Rat.

34
00:02:12.741 --> 00:02:16.342
The three friends rushed out the door.

35
00:02:16.343 --> 00:02:21.903
Together they set out for Toad Hall.
